{"id":"imperativo.arreglos.calurosos-ordenar","lesson":"imperativo.arreglos","kind":"ordenar","level":"brote","required":false,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordering the hot days"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The lines of a program that shows the days hotter than the average are mixed up. Put them in order so that it works."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[],"variant":[],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"First the array and the accumulator are declared; the first pass reads and adds; then the average is computed; the second pass compares each day. The average cannot go before the first pass."}]}],"teachers":[],"evaluation":{"type":"order_program","head":"Algoritmo DiasCalurosos","tail":"FinAlgoritmo","blocks":["Si temperaturas[i] > promedio Entonces","Escribir \"Día \", i;","Definir promedio Como Real <- suma / 7;","Para i <- 0 Hasta 6 Hacer","suma <- suma + temperaturas[i];","FinPara","Para i <- 0 Hasta 6 Hacer","Leer temperaturas[i];","Dimension temperaturas[7] Como Entero;","Definir suma Como Entero <- 0;","FinPara","FinSi"],"solution":[8,9,6,7,4,5,2,3,0,1,11,10],"cases":[{"inputs":["20","23","19","25","22","18","26"],"expected":"Día 1\nDía 3\nDía 4\nDía 6","hidden":false},{"inputs":["10","10","10","10","10","10","30"],"expected":"Día 6","hidden":true},{"inputs":["30","10","10","10","10","10","10"],"expected":"Día 0","hidden":true}]}}
